  "guid": null,
  "name": "Insurance Plus",
  "slug": "insurance-plus",
  "teaser": "Insured items aren't dropped on death.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2115.png",
  "downloads": 25505,
  "favourites_count": 3,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Basics</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>An update to JustNU’s <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/894-insurance\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Insurance+</a> for the latest version of SPT!</p>\n<p>Changes the insurance system to allow you to keep your insured items equipped upon death.</p>\n<p>Item’s dropped in raid will be handled normally through the vanilla game’s return system.</p>\n<p>Make sure you insure container’s with insured items. If the container the item is in isn’t insured then it’ll be lost.</p>\n<p>If you’d like to increase insurance prices you can do so with this mod <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2117-trader-qol/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">TraderQoL</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Simply extract mattdokn-insuranceplus.zip into your game folder</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Config</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>LoseInsuranceOnItemAfterDeath\n<ul>\n<li>Default: false</li>\n<li>If this is enabled, after dying in raid. The insured items you kept equipped will lose their insured status.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>LoseAmmoInMagazines\n<ul>\n<li>Default: false</li>\n<li>If this is enabled, ammo that is chambered or loaded into an insured magazine/weapon will be removed.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>If you see anything that stands out to you, please let me know in the comments or submit an <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/m-barneto/InsurancePlus/issues/new\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">issue on github</a>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Insured items inside an uninsured container will not be returned to you on death.</li>\n<li>Bullets in magazines stay after death. (Round in chamber gets removed though lol)</li>\n<li>You are able to insure items that are needed to be placed for quests and get them back after the raid, this won’t be fixed as it would require adding a client component to see if you planted an insured item. <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/894-insurance/#comments/comment28976\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">link</a></li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support My Work</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Never feel obligated to donate for support.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
